      <div class="testi-lead-body">
        <blockquote>"I already had the pieces. An attendance system for the front desk, a website and funnel builder to bring families in, email campaign software to stay in touch. Separate tools, separate databases, none of them talking to each other, and not one worked the way real families do. What I actually needed did not exist: one system that brings families in, keeps them engaged, runs the center, and automates the busywork so I can get back to the kids. Now it does."</blockquote>
        <div>
          <span class="testi-name">Bincy S.</span>
          <span class="testi-role">Kumon Center Owner</span>
        </div>
      </div>
